---
import { getStaticPaths } from '../../utils/blog-paths'; // We'll create this utility
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Badge } from '../../components/ui';
import { formatDate } from '../../utils/format';
import type { Blog } from '../../types/blog';

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  // In a real application, you would fetch this from your database
  const mockPosts: Blog[] = [
    {
      _id: { toString: () => '1' },
      title: 'The Future of Fintech: How AI is Revolutionizing Financial Services',
      slug: 'future-of-fintech-ai-revolution',
      excerpt: 'Discover how artificial intelligence is transforming the financial industry, from automated trading to personalized banking experiences.',
      content: `
# The Future of Fintech: How AI is Revolutionizing Financial Services

The financial technology (fintech) industry has been at the forefront of digital transformation, and artificial intelligence (AI) is now accelerating this evolution at an unprecedented pace. From automated trading algorithms to personalized banking experiences, AI is reshaping every aspect of financial services.

## The Current Landscape

The global fintech market, valued at over $300 billion, is experiencing a paradigm shift. Traditional banking institutions are collaborating with fintech startups to integrate AI-powered solutions that enhance customer experience and operational efficiency.

### Key Areas of AI Impact

**1. Automated Trading and Investment Management**
AI algorithms can process vast amounts of market data in real-time, identifying patterns and executing trades with precision that surpasses human capabilities. Robo-advisors are democratizing investment management, making sophisticated portfolio optimization accessible to retail investors.

**2. Risk Assessment and Credit Scoring**
Machine learning models analyze alternative data sources to assess creditworthiness more accurately than traditional scoring methods. This is particularly beneficial for underbanked populations who lack extensive credit histories.

**3. Fraud Detection and Prevention**
AI systems continuously monitor transaction patterns to identify suspicious activities in real-time, significantly reducing fraud losses while minimizing false positives that could inconvenience legitimate customers.

**4. Customer Service and Personalization**
Chatbots and virtual assistants powered by natural language processing provide 24/7 customer support, while recommendation engines offer personalized financial products based on individual spending patterns and financial goals.

## Challenges and Considerations

While AI presents tremendous opportunities, the fintech industry must address several challenges:

- **Data Privacy and Security**: Protecting sensitive financial information while leveraging data for AI insights
- **Regulatory Compliance**: Navigating complex financial regulations while implementing innovative AI solutions
- **Algorithmic Bias**: Ensuring AI systems make fair and unbiased decisions across diverse populations
- **Explainability**: Maintaining transparency in AI decision-making processes for regulatory and customer trust

## The Road Ahead

The future of fintech lies in the seamless integration of AI technologies that enhance human decision-making rather than replacing it entirely. We can expect to see:

- **Hyper-personalized Financial Services**: AI will enable banks to offer products and services tailored to individual customers' unique financial situations and goals
- **Predictive Financial Health**: Advanced analytics will help customers anticipate and prevent financial difficulties before they occur
- **Embedded Finance**: AI will facilitate the integration of financial services into non-financial platforms and applications
- **Quantum Computing Integration**: As quantum computing matures, it will supercharge AI capabilities in areas like risk modeling and cryptography

## Conclusion

The convergence of AI and fintech is creating unprecedented opportunities to democratize financial services, improve accessibility, and enhance customer experiences. Organizations that successfully navigate the challenges while embracing AI innovation will be well-positioned to lead the next generation of financial services.

As we move forward, the focus should be on responsible AI implementation that prioritizes customer benefit, regulatory compliance, and ethical considerations. The future of finance is intelligent, inclusive, and increasingly automated.
      `,
      featuredImage: '/images/blog/fintech-ai-detail.jpg',
      category: 'fintech',
      tags: ['ai', 'machine-learning', 'banking', 'automation', 'innovation'],
      author: { toString: () => 'author1' },
      status: 'published' as const,
      publishedAt: new Date('2024-01-15'),
      createdAt: new Date('2024-01-15'),
      updatedAt: new Date('2024-01-15'),
      views: 1250,
      readingTime: 8,
      seo: {
        metaTitle: 'The Future of Fintech and AI Revolution',
        metaDescription: 'How AI is transforming financial services and what it means for the future.',
        keywords: ['fintech', 'ai', 'artificial intelligence', 'banking']
      }
    }
  ];

  return mockPosts.map((post) => ({
    params: { slug: post.slug },
    props: { post },
  }));
}

const { post } = Astro.props;
const { slug } = Astro.params;

const categoryColors = {
  technology: 'blue',
  fintech: 'green',
  iot: 'purple',
  security: 'red',
  acquisition: 'yellow',
  ai: 'indigo',
} as const;
---

<BaseLayout 
  title={post.title}
  description={post.excerpt}
  keywords={post.seo.keywords}
  image={post.featuredImage}
  type="article"
  publishedTime={post.publishedAt?.toISOString()}
  modifiedTime={post.updatedAt?.toISOString()}
  author="Aargonic Team"
  section={post.category}
  tags={post.tags}
>
  <article class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <header class="relative">
      <div class="aspect-video md:aspect-[21/9] overflow-hidden">
        <img 
          src={post.featuredImage || '/images/placeholder-blog-detail.jpg'} 
          alt={post.title}
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-40"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <Badge variant={categoryColors[post.category as keyof typeof categoryColors] || 'blue'}>
              {post.category}
            </Badge>
            
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">
              {post.title}
            </h1>
            
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center text-white/90 text-sm space-x-6">
              <span>{formatDate(post.publishedAt || post.createdAt)}</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <span>{post.readingTime} min read</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <span>{post.views} views</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12">
        
        <!-- Article Content -->
        <main class="lg:col-span-3">
          <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
            <div class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
              {post.excerpt}
            </div>
            
            <div class="prose-content" set:html={post.content.replace(/\n/g, '<br/>')} />
          </div>

          <!-- Tags -->
          <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Tags</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              {post.tags.map((tag) => (
                <a 
                  href={`/blog?tag=${tag}`}
                  class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-sm rounded-full hover:bg-blue-100 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors"
                >
                  #{tag}
                </a>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Social Share -->
          <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Share this article</h3>
            <div class="flex space-x-4">
              <a 
                href={`https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=${encodeURIComponent(post.title)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(Astro.url.href)}`}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors"
              >
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M8.29 20.251c7.547 0 11.675-6.253 11.675-11.675 0-.178 0-.355-.012-.53A8.348 8.348 0 0022 5.92a8.19 8.19 0 01-2.357.646 4.118 4.118 0 001.804-2.27 8.224 8.224 0 01-2.605.996 4.107 4.107 0 00-6.993 3.743 11.65 11.65 0 01-8.457-4.287 4.106 4.106 0 001.27 5.477A4.072 4.072 0 012.8 9.713v.052a4.105 4.105 0 003.292 4.022 4.095 4.095 0 01-1.853.07 4.108 4.108 0 003.834 2.85A8.233 8.233 0 012 18.407a11.616 11.616 0 006.29 1.84" />
                </svg>
                Twitter
              </a>
              
              <a 
                href={`https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=${encodeURIComponent(Astro.url.href)}`}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-blue-700 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-800 transition-colors"
              >
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z" />
                </svg>
                LinkedIn
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </main>

        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <aside class="lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="sticky top-8 space-y-8">
            
            <!-- Author Info -->
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 mb-4">
                <img 
                  src="/images/authors/team-avatar.jpg" 
                  alt="Author"
                  class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover"
                  onerror="this.src='/images/authors/default-avatar.png'"
                />
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Aargonic Team</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Technology Experts</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                Our team of technology experts brings decades of experience in fintech, 
                IoT, cybersecurity, and emerging technologies.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Table of Contents -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Table of Contents</h4>
              <nav class="space-y-2">
                <a href="#current-landscape" class="block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">The Current Landscape</a>
                <a href="#ai-impact" class="block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Key Areas of AI Impact</a>
                <a href="#challenges" class="block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Challenges and Considerations</a>
                <a href="#road-ahead" class="block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">The Road Ahead</a>
                <a href="#conclusion" class="block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Conclusion</a>
              </nav>
            </div>

            <!-- Related Articles -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Articles</h4>
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <a href="/blog/iot-security-best-practices" class="block group">
                  <h5 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
                    IoT Security Best Practices: Protecting Your Connected Devices
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">6 min read</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/blog/building-scalable-ai-systems" class="block group">
                  <h5 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors line-clamp-2">
                    Building Scalable AI Systems: Architecture and Best Practices
                  </h5>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">12 min read</p>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Newsletter CTA -->
            <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-2">Stay Updated</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-blue-700 mb-4">
                Get more insights like this delivered to your inbox.
              </p>
              <a 
                href="/#newsletter" 
                class="block w-full bg-blue-600 text-white text-center py-2 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors font-medium text-sm"
              >
                Subscribe Now
              </a>
            </div>

          </div>
        </aside>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Posts -->
    <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">More Articles</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <!-- Related posts would be dynamically loaded here -->
          <div class="text-center text-gray-600">
            <p>Related articles will be displayed here</p>
            <a href="/blog" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-medium">View all articles →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-content {
    @apply text-gray-800 leading-relaxed;
  }
  
  .prose-content h1,
  .prose-content h2,
  .prose-content h3,
  .prose-content h4,
  .prose-content h5,
  .prose-content h6 {
    @apply font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4;
  }
  
  .prose-content h1 { @apply text-3xl; }
  .prose-content h2 { @apply text-2xl; }
  .prose-content h3 { @apply text-xl; }
  .prose-content h4 { @apply text-lg; }
  
  .prose-content p {
    @apply mb-6;
  }
  
  .prose-content ul,
  .prose-content ol {
    @apply mb-6 pl-6;
  }
  
  .prose-content li {
    @apply mb-2;
  }
  
  .prose-content blockquote {
    @apply border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-6 py-2 my-6 italic text-gray-700 bg-blue-50;
  }
  
  .prose-content code {
    @apply bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm font-mono;
  }
  
  .prose-content strong {
    @apply font-semibold text-gray-900;
  }
</style>